| No normalization | ✅ Normalizer 분리 |
| No verification | ✅ Verifier 분리 |
| No persistence | ✅ InventoryStore 분리 |
| Failure isolation | ✅ SourceResult per source |
| Credential handling | ✅ Environment only |

