|------|------|
| Raw → Normalized | ✅ RedfishNormalizer, SSHNormalizer |
| Schema v1.0 compliance | ✅ ServerInventory 생성 |
| Vendor abstraction | ✅ DellAdapter, HPEAdapter |
| Storage normalization | ✅ Phase 7.6 완료 |

### Verifier

| 책임 | 상태 |
|------|------|
| Multi-source comparison | ✅ FieldComparator |
| Missing vs Conflict | ✅ 구분됨 |
| Single-source semantics | ✅ SKIPPED 처리 |
| No persistence | ✅ VerificationResult only |

### Orchestrator

| 책임 | 상태 |
|------|------|
| Pipeline execution | ✅ Collect → Normalize → Verify |
| Canonical selection | ✅ Priority-based (Redfish > SSH) |
| SourceResult tracking | ✅ Per-source status |
| OrchestrationResult | ✅ SUCCESS/PARTIAL/FAILED |
| No direct persistence | ✅ Caller responsible |

### Findings

| ID | Severity | Decision | Evidence |
|----|----------|----------|----------|
| CP-001 | INFORMATIONAL | KEEP | Pipeline 책임 분리 명확. Orchestrator 가 persistence 를 가지지 않음. |

