## 5. INVENTORY STORE REVIEW

### Architecture

| 원칙 | 상태 |
|------|------|
| Registry ≠ Inventory | ✅ `server_registry` ≠ `inventory_snapshots` |
| Append-only snapshots | ✅ `INSERT OR IGNORE` |
| Current pointer | ✅ `server_registry.current_snapshot_id` |
| Atomic transaction | ✅ SQLite transaction |
| run_id idempotency | ✅ `snap-{run_id}` deduplication |
| Verification history | ✅ `verifications` table |
| Endpoint registry | ✅ `endpoints` table (separate) |

### Findings

| ID | Severity | Decision | Evidence |
|----|----------|----------|----------|
| IS-001 | MEDIUM | FIX LATER | `check_same_thread=False` 가 test fixture 에만 적용됨. Production 은 기본값. 향후 concurrent collection 시 고려 필요. |
| IS-002 | INFORMATIONAL | KEEP | Hardware identity (`serial_number`, `service_tag`) 와 OS reinstall 구분 가능. |

